# Scaffy — Design Decisions

- **Detailed decision log:** [`docs/decisions.md`](../../docs/decisions.md) — context, alternatives, ADR status. Update there first for new architecture; sync only short invariants here. **Mandatory after Agent-mode implementation** — see `decisions-log.mdc`.

## App Vision
- **Name:** Scaffy — *"AI that teaches you to build good code, not just builds for you."*
- **Core concept:** Scaffolding + Friction — AI generates code step by step; targeted questions block the next chunk until the user answers correctly.

## Tech Stack
- SvelteKit 5, SPA mode (no SSR/SSG)
- Monaco Editor (VS Code engine)
- shadcn-svelte + dark theme
- Claude API (structured JSON + code)
- GitHub + Vercel

## Claude API — Core Flow
- User submits a prompt (e.g. *"Generate a Svelte 5 login dialog component with password validation"*)
- Claude returns **structured JSON** scaffolds in one shot (`POST /api/scaffold`, REST)
- **Session intro** streams a concept preview in Ask in parallel (`POST /api/chat-session-intro`, SSE)
- Unlocked scaffold code via **`setValue()`** (typewriter `executeEdits` planned, ADR-011)
- **Learning Card** in Monaco **`viewZone`**; next scaffold after correct answer
- **Lesson start gate** before first scaffold (`lessonStarted`, ADR-021)

## Claude API — Architecture Rules

### No direct browser API calls
- The API key must **never** appear in the client bundle.
- Claude is reached only via SvelteKit **`src/routes/api/<endpoint>/+server.ts`** handlers (`scaffold`, `chat`, `chat-session-intro`). Prompts live under `src/lib/server/scaffold/` and `src/lib/server/chat/` (`ask-system-prompt.md`, `session-intro-system-prompt.md`).
- `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` is injected via `import { ANTHROPIC_API_KEY } from '$env/static/private'`.
- Client code calls only same-origin `/api/...` paths — never `api.anthropic.com`.

```
Browser → /api/<endpoint> (SvelteKit server route) → api.anthropic.com
```

### Streaming vs REST
- **`/api/scaffold` (Learn):** REST — structured JSON (`json_schema`); full response before Monaco
- **`/api/chat-session-intro`:** SSE — concept preview while lesson loads
- **`/api/chat` (Ask):** SSE — Socratic tutor; temperature 0.55; max_tokens 2048; history cap 30

### Model
- Logical IDs: `claude-sonnet-4-5`, `claude-sonnet-4-6` (`anthropic-client.ts`, `ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_MODEL`).

### Environment variables
- `.env.local` — real key, never committed.
- `.env.example` — committed, documents required variables.

## State Architecture
- Global **rune singletons** in `src/lib/global-state/` (`.svelte.ts`: `session`, `translation`, `onboarding`). See each file header for what persists to `localStorage` vs memory-only.
- State lives at three levels: **URL** (routing), **global/component state** (SPA), **localStorage**.
- Learning progress is persisted in localStorage.

## Repository layout (source conventions)
- **Global rune singletons:** `src/lib/global-state/` — session, translation (locale), onboarding. **`src/lib/i18n/`** — static `translations.ts` + store adapters in `index.ts` (`$language` / `$messages`).
- **Routes:** `src/routes/**/+page.svelte` thin — import view from `lib/`; URL = folder (no `-page` suffix on route files).
- **Feature views:** `src/lib/components/<area>/` (`home`, `sessions`, `chat`, `editor`, `shell`, …) — domain copy, data, wiring.
- **Generic UI:** `src/lib/components/ui/` — domain-agnostic primitives on **shadcn-svelte**; install via `shadcn-svelte add` before hand-rolling (ADR-017); custom `ui/` only when composing shadcn or documented in `docs/decisions.md`.
- **Scrollbars:** hover-fade app-wide — default `ScrollArea` `type="hover"` (incl. modals); `--scaffy-scrollbar-*` in `scroll-area.css` + Monaco. No `type="always"` in product UI. See `scrollbars.mdc`.
- **Assets:** `src/lib/assets/` — static SVG/images; avoid Svelte wrappers unless dynamic/themed.
- **Unclear placement?** Ask before creating components (ADR-016, `component-layout.mdc`).
- **HTTP API:** `src/routes/api/<endpoint>/+server.ts` — one folder per surface (`scaffold` REST, `chat` SSE, `chat-session-intro` SSE).
- **Server-only library:** `src/lib/server/` — never imported from the client. Subfolders per endpoint: `scaffold/`, `chat/` (Ask + session-intro prompts). Shared modules (e.g. `anthropic-client.ts`) at `server/` root until a `shared/` subfolder is warranted.

## Monaco Integration
- **`changeViewZones`** — custom DOM in editor flow: Learning Card (Svelte mount) and loading spinner (plain DOM, rAF)
- **`setValue`** — scaffold snippets; loading/wait `<!-- HTML comments -->`
- **`overlayWidgets`** as fallback when viewZones are insufficient
- Per-scaffold typewriter (`executeEdits`, ~15 ms/char) — planned (ADR-011)

## SPA Mode
- This is a pure SPA — do not add SSR data loading (`+page.server.ts` load functions) outside of the `/api/` route directory.
- **Route handlers** for HTTP APIs live in `src/routes/api/`. **Shared server-only** code (Anthropic client, prompts, schemas) lives in `src/lib/server/` — see Repository layout above.

